  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Esoteric Energy Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c6/Jedi_and_Sith.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201217234435\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Jedi and Sith\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c6/Jedi_and_Sith.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20201217234435\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c6/Jedi_and_Sith.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20201217234435 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c6/Jedi_and_Sith.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201217234435 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Jedi and Sith\" width=\"270\" height=\"288\" data-image-key=\"Jedi_and_Sith.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Jedi and Sith.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Force users (Star Wars franchise) can convert the esoteric energy known as the Force into a variety of effects, with some being able to generate electrical energy using it.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Convert esoteric energy into other usable forms.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb esoteric energy and convert into other usable forms</b>. Sub-Power of <a href=\"/wiki/Esoteric_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Esoteric Energy Manipulation\">Esoteric Energy Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEsoteric_Energy_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Esoteric Transduction</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEsoteric_Energy_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can absorb esoteric energy and convert it to any type of energy and vice versa meaning to absorb any type of energy and turn it into esoteric energy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEsoteric_Energy_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Capacitor\" title=\"Electric Capacitor\">Store</a> and convert esoteric energy into other types of energy, such as:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Freezing\" title=\"Freezing\">Cold</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Generation\" title=\"Ice Generation\">Ice</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Generation\" title=\"Cosmic Generation\">Cosmic</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Generation\" title=\"Lunar Generation\">Lunar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Generation\" title=\"Solar Generation\">Solar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Generation\" title=\"Stellar Generation\">Stellar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Time_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Time Energy Generation\">Time</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Generation\" title=\"Electricity Generation\">Electricity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Generation\" title=\"Fire Generation\">Fire</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Generation\" title=\"Gravity Generation\">Gravity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Generation\" title=\"Light Generation\">Light</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magnetism_Generation\" title=\"Magnetism Generation\">Magnetism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Generation\">Kinetics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Generation\" title=\"Plasma Generation\">Plasma</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Generation\" title=\"Radiation Generation\">Radiation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Wave_Generation\" title=\"Sound Wave Generation\">Sound</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEsoteric_Energy_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Esoteric_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Esoteric Energy Manipulation\">Esoteric Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEsoteric_Energy_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May require focus to convert energy into another.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb/convert.</li>\n<li>May only be able to convert certain type of esoteric energy.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEsoteric_Energy_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Seven Energies of the Universe Users (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Force wielders (<i>Star Wars franchise</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260807210950\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 113/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 212/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.167      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%   13.167      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:446467-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260807210950 and revision id 2711142. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
